values ('ap_statistics', 1, '1.12', array['1.12']::text[], 'vocabulary', 'Bias in sampling', 'Bias in a sampling method is a systematic error in the sampling procedure that results in a statistic being consistently larger or consistently smaller than the parameter it estimates.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=task0067-reference-pilot-2026-10-09; candidate=ap_statistics-u1-r2-010; ced=1.12.A.1: Bias in a sampling method is a systematic error in the sampling procedure')
