values ('ap_statistics', 1, '1.12', array['1.12']::text[], 'convention', 'Nonrandom sampling introduces potential bias', 'Nonrandom sampling methods, such as convenience or voluntary response samples, introduce potential bias because they do not use random chance to select individuals.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=task0067-reference-pilot-2026-10-09; candidate=ap_statistics-u1-r2-012; ced=1.12.A.6: Nonrandom sampling methods (e.g., samples chosen by convenience or voluntary response) introduce potential bias')
