values ('ap_statistics', 1, '1.13', array['1.13']::text[], 'convention', 'Purpose of random assignment', 'Random assignment creates treatment groups as similar as possible with respect to extraneous sources of variation, so each extraneous variable''s distribution is approximately the same across treatment groups.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Cite random assignment, not random selection, when explaining why an experiment''s treatment groups are comparable.', 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=task0067-reference-pilot-2026-10-09; candidate=ap_statistics-u1-r2-011; ced=1.13.A.7: The purpose of random assignment is to create treatment groups that are as similar as possible with respect to extraneous sources of variation.')
